  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">IB ACIO Gr-II Executive Final Result 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-03T17:26:10+05:30\">June 3, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">5:26 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.mha.gov.in/notifications/vacancies\"><strong>Intelligence Bureau (IB), Ministry of Home Affairs</strong></a>, has released the<strong> Final Result</strong>&nbsp;on its&nbsp;<strong>official website</strong> for the <strong>Assistant Central Intelligence Officer Grade II / Executive Post.</strong> The tier-II exam was held on <strong>11 January 2026,</strong>&nbsp;and the last date to submit the application form was&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"250\">10 August 2025</strong>. Candidates can check their <b>Final Result</b>&nbsp;using their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">IB ACIO Gr-II Executive Final Result 2026 – Out</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">IB ACIO Grade-II / Executive Examination 2025 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/ib-acio-gr-ii-executive-2025/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date: <strong>19 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>10 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <strong>10 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date :<strong> 16, 17 &amp; 18 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card Date : <strong>13 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Answer Key :<strong> 22 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result : <strong>21 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Tier-II Exam Date :<strong> 11 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Tier-II Exam City Details : <span s