\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">3717 Posts</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">IB ACIO Grade-II / Executive Recruitment 2025 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.2111%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 16.8002%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 60.9886%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.2111%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IB ACIO Grade-II / Executive</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 16.8002%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">3717</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 60.9886%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Bachelor’s degree in <strong>any stream</strong> from a recognized university.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download IB ACIO Grade-II / Executive Final Result 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"175\">\n<p data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"175\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Open your internet browser on your phone or computer</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"242\">\n<p data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"242\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the <strong data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"240\">official website of the Intelligence Bureau (IB)</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"338\">\n<p data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"338\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, go to the <strong data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"328\">Recruitment / Latest Updates / Candidate Information</strong> section</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"441\">\n<p data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"441\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Look for the notification that mentions <strong data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"439\">ACIO Grade-II/Executive Final Result 2026</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"485\">\n<p data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"485\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on the <strong data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"478\">Result</strong> link</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"573\">\n<p data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"573\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The exam city information will open in <strong data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"541\">PDF format</strong> (or a page with your details)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"668\">\n<p data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"668\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">If it opens as a PDF, use the <strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"624\">search feature</strong> to find your <strong data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"666\">registration/roll number</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"737\">\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"737\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download or save the <strong data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"720\">PDF or result page</strong> to your device</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"792\">\n<p data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"792\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Take a <strong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"759\">printout</strong> if needed for future reference</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;IB ACIO Grade-II / Executive Recruitment 2025 : Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Tier-I Written Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Tier-II Written Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Interview (100 Marks)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Medical Examination</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Download Final Result</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"